      "text": {
        "en": "Clients widely value the clinical competence and kindness of attending veterinarians, noting thorough examinations and helpful medical guidance. However, front-desk interactions receive recurring criticism, with several reviewers describing dismissive reception attitudes, rigid policy enforcement, and contentious exchanges over appointment scheduling."
      }
