        "en": "Patient and gentle handling of pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog and cat owners commend the gentle touch demonstrated by veterinarians during physical checkups, routine shots, and minor procedures. Reviewers note that staff handle pets with genuine affection, ensuring that nervous animals feel secure and supported throughout their veterinary visits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "negative",
