      "title": {
        "en": "Administrative challenges and telephone delays"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Communication receives predominantly critical feedback from dissatisfied visitors. Clients cite unreturned telephone inquiries, slow turnaround times for electronic mail updates, and rigid enforcement of short arrival grace periods. Several reviewers also note contentious public responses from clinic management to online reviews."
      }
    }
